{"_id":"68a736358ec3d8323af1db9a","nodeId":"HEqfA6An6ZeT3z4R610en","roadmapSlug":"rust","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:32.844Z","description":"# Mocking and Property-based Testing\n\nMocking creates fake functions/objects for testing different scenarios. Rust uses external libraries like `mockito`, `mockall`, and `mockall_double` for mocking capabilities. Property-based testing generates test cases automatically to verify code behavior across a wide range of inputs.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Docs.rs: mockito","url":"https://docs.rs/mockito/latest/mockito/","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfddba"},{"type":"article","title":"Docs.rs: mockall","url":"https://docs.rs/mockall/latest/mockall/","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfddbb"},{"type":"article","title":"Docs.rs: mockall_double","url":"https://docs.rs/mockall_double/latest/mockall_double/","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfddbc"},{"type":"article","title":"Mocking in Rust: Mockall and alternatives","url":"https://blog.logrocket.com/mocking-rust-mockall-alternatives/","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfddbd"},{"type":"feed","title":"Explore top posts about Testing","url":"https://app.daily.dev/tags/testing?ref=roadmapsh","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfddbe"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:07:02.070Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/rust/content/HEqfA6An6ZeT3z4R610en.md"}